# Guard rail: this suite must never carry live Power Automate trigger URLs
# (SAS signatures are bearer credentials) into source control. Anything
# matching these patterns is operator-local only. See config/README.md and
# reports/CONSOLIDATION_REPORT.md section 13 for the full policy.
*.full.js
*.full.json
*.local.js
*.local.json
config/config.local.js
config/runtime.config.full.js
registry/unified-registry.full.json
tests/contract-probes.full.json
exports/private/
private/
